{"type":"text","timestamp":1788213184140,"sessionID":"ses_fa630cc01ffefTEin5wfy7Iwv6","part":{"id":"prt_059cfc2c40015Q0ThPfZSJukji","messageID":"msg_059cfb6f4001Wa84HU3voLdOTU","sessionID":"ses_fa630cc01ffefTEin5wfy7Iwv6","type":"text","text":"The implementation issue is already visible in `scheduler.py`: it ignores the injected clock and random source and shuffles equal-priority tasks, which makes ordering flaky. I’m patching that now, then I’ll install `pytest` locally if needed and verify.","time":{"start":1788213183172,"end":1788213184132},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_095c3650987d2b95016a95f7bf0d0487d2beaadff77e4cb47f","phase":"commentary"}}}}
